  unitName: Hades Wave Sareas
  unitId: 20755
  unitNumber: 1266
  description: Sareas is most renowned for his role in holding the East Gate, the
    last imperial strongpoint to fall to the God Army. Despite his gallantry in battle,
    rumor holds that he was detested by those close to the imperial family. However,
    there are almost no official records to support these claims of slander and conspiracy.
    Even the diary of the second imperial prince, who should have been the worst
    victim of Sareas's alleged schemes, contains no mentions of this nature whatsoever.
  summonDesc: That conceited muscle head knows nothing of the truth...my hatred knows
    no bounds.
  fusionDesc: Is this all? How pathetic...<br>Oh! W-Were you listening?<br>I was
    merely remembering the lines of an old theatrical performance, old friend!
  evoDesc: Better than nothing, I suppose...<br>Oh? Thank-you, my friend!<br>Now,
    how to put this new power to best use?
  element: 2
  rarity: 5
